{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["זאת חקת התורה — and before us he will explain about which תורה he is speaking, for it is written: ״זאת התורה אדם כי ימות באהל״ — that is: the חקת התורה that He spoke to Moshe is ״זאת התורה״." "פרה אדומה — He commanded to take, to make the instruction for the purification of a man who dies in a tent — to become purified through it: one who touches, one who carries, and one who enters the tent."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:50:33.994161079Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}